[en.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_AGARICUS_FOREST]
Develop Agaricus Forest

[en.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_AGARICUS_FOREST_desc]
The Agaricus Forest, with its stunning scenery and several large freshwater lakes, is more than capable of supplying the needs of all the ponies on the rock farm. Under the supervision of the new department, we should ensure its proper development and protection.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_AGARICUS_FOREST]
开发松茸森林

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_AGARICUS_FOREST_desc]
松茸森林景色优美，其中的几个大型淡水湖足以供应整个采石农场小马的使用，在新部门的监管下，我们应该对其进行妥善的开发和保护。

